did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 42 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Storm-Buried%20Caravan\">Storm-Buried Caravan</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 40 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 15 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Camp\">Thak Scout Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sun%20King's%20Tomb\">Sun King&#39;s Tomb</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2122, 734 <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Behemoth's%20Wallow\">Behemoth&#39;s Wallow</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sirocco\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-howling-sirocco\"><img src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Howling Sirocco</b><span>Lv 40</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Dust Devil: <a href=\"#/monster/dust-devil\">Dust Devil</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sand-devil\">Sand Devil</a> <span class=\"muted\">(37)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"Sirocco\"></div><h3>Sirocco</h3><table>\n      <